        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Soft Flowing Avon\n- People: Thomas Arne, David Garrick\n- Topics: Songs, Composition\n\nFacts:\n- Thomas Arne was born in London on 12 March 1710.\n- Thomas Arne was an English composer best known for the patriotic song \"Rule Britannia\".\n- Soft Flowing Avon was a song from 1769.\n- Thomas Arne wrote the music for the 1769 song Soft Flowing Avon.\n- David Garrick wrote the lyrics for the 1769 song Soft Flowing Avon.\n- Thomas Arne died in London on 5 March 1778.",
